{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美國華盛頓有人在二戰紀念碑塗鴉，並將泡泡液倒進噴水池，警方拘捕一名疑犯。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.GRAFFITI-0300.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026TY2CouygWo1786747425.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.GRAFFITI-0300.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">華盛頓國家廣場二戰紀念碑，過去周四遭人噴上紅、綠色油漆，寫上「乾淨的手、骯髒的錢」等字樣，噴水池就有大量泡沫。總統特朗普指事件是對陣亡美軍士兵最大侮辱，內政部指絕不容忍這類破壞行為。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.GRAFFITI-0300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026EIcfr0Lirf1786747420.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.GRAFFITI-0300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">到了周五，華盛頓特區檢察官皮羅指當局拘捕女子法里斯，她被控破壞美國財產罪，以及損壞退伍軍人紀念碑罪，兩宗罪最高可判囚10年，當局正調查犯案動機。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T22:59:35.552222+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}